From c91a2d0884a2a86997f26d967fc77d347514d29a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 16:49:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Mac: Images sent row in the composer and the outfit sheet

Estimates decode sentImages; the composer shows Images sent (n) with each
image's role (why in the tooltip), Changed by Claude, and Reset to automatic.
The draft carries Claude's choice (sent) to estimates and Generate; Reset
sends sent: null. The new-outfit sheet reads a dry-run estimate, refreshes on
the sentImages live event, and Reset sends sentImages: null.

